&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level German proficiency (C1/C2) &lt;/strong&gt;is required for this role. Candidates must be able to lead customer workshops, conduct executive presentations, and manage stakeholder interactions in German.&lt;/p&gt;
