&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager (Technical) who wants to help define how trust is built into the next generation of AI systems. At Affinidi, we’re building the Trust Fabric product suite to give AI agents verifiable identity, policy guardrails, and real-time observability, so organisations can move from promising proofs of concept to secure, governed production deployments with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for builders. You’ll work side by side with engineering to turn ambitious ideas into real, high-impact products, fast, iteratively, and with strong product judgment. You’ll take on complex, ambiguous challenges that don’t come with a playbook, bring structure to what matters, and help the team move with clarity, speed, and conviction. You’ll also collaborate with deeply engaged teams and senior leaders in an environment that expects high standards, values ownership, and gives you the chance to shape meaningful products from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you like combining technical depth, product thinking, and execution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape and deliver solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineers to define and refine solutions early, helping move ideas from concept to production in practical, incremental steps while staying close enough to implementation to understand trade-offs and guide decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive focused, outcome-oriented delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance user needs, market context, and execution speed while focusing on getting working solutions into users’ hands for validation, then iterate based on feedback and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work through ambiguity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership of areas where requirements are not fully defined, structure problems into clear, actionable paths forward, and maintain momentum even as direction continues to evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own product direction:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to product strategy and roadmap definition, align short-term priorities with longer-term platform thinking, and make thoughtful trade-offs that support both delivery and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate across stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work across engineering, design, and go-to-market teams, engage effectively with senior and executive stakeholders, and bring alignment and clarity in environments with diverse perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be developer-obsessed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand developer workflows and key pain points, and help improve integration, usability, and the overall product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Core experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You bring 5+ years of experience in Technical Product Management, a strong technical background that lets you engage deeply with engineering topics, hands-on experience working with APIs, systems, and integrations, and a proven track record of delivering products in close collaboration with engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical depth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are comfortable understanding how systems are designed and operate in practice, able to engage in technical discussions, challenge assumptions, and evaluate trade-offs, and willing to go into detail when needed by reviewing flows, investigating issues, or clarifying implementation approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You take ownership from problem to outcome, are comfortable working with ambiguity and evolving priorities, combine structured thinking with a bias toward action, and can move between big-picture strategy and practical execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You communicate effectively across technical and non-technical audiences, are comfortable working with experienced, highly engaged stakeholders, and know how to build alignment and drive decisions forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;It’s a plus if you have had exposure to identity, distributed systems, or similar domains, and experience in fast-paced, product-led environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A team that values ownership, quality, and speed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Close collaboration between product and engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hybrid working model in Berlin + flexible hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unlimited vacation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A strong environment to learn, build, and have impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;backend systems (TypeScript, microservices, cloud)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead multiple engineering teams building the &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi Elements &lt;/strong&gt;platform. While you will manage and support teams working across the full stack (backend, frontend, platform infrastructure), your technical depth and demonstrated experience in backend engineering will be crucial in guiding architecture, ensuring quality, and driving technical strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: you will grow high-performing fullstack teams, define best practices across the stack, and remain hands-on in critical technical decisions to ensure our systems are secure, scalable, and performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work culture at &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&lt;/strong&gt; is shaped by the following tenets:   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unapologetically customer-focused &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We invest in cultures and teams to enable high performance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embraces experimentation and builds fast &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have the courage to be misunderstood &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We work together to unlock data   &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams, providing &lt;strong&gt;vision, direction, and coaching&lt;/strong&gt; to managers, staff engineers, and senior ICs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;engineering execution and on-time delivery&lt;/strong&gt; of secure, performant, and customer-centric systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and contribute to the design and development of &lt;strong&gt;high-scale, high-performance distributed production systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and business stakeholders to define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;technology roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices, delivery processes, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt; to scale effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineering leaders, fostering &lt;strong&gt;career growth, leadership depth, and technical excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of &lt;strong&gt;emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing innovative approaches to improve scalability, architecture, and developer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion &lt;strong&gt;privacy by design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;security-first principles&lt;/strong&gt;, and high-quality engineering across backend and frontend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will be a great match if you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading engineering organizations in global, high-growth environments while driving on-time delivery of high-quality systems at scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong &lt;strong&gt; leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;: coaching, mentoring, developing leaders, and fostering high-performing, inclusive teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;strategic vision&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;practical execution&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning engineering teams with business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;strong&gt;Dart &lt;/strong&gt;experience is preferred; familiarity with C#, Go, or similar is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt; React/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrates solid understanding of modern web and/or mobile development practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven success in &lt;strong&gt;designing, deploying, and scaling microservices&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud environments, specifically, Amazon Web Services (AWS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for &lt;strong&gt;privacy, security, cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;, and resilient system design; experience with &lt;strong&gt;asynchronous cryptography and identity/authentication domains&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, growing teams while staying engaged in critical technical decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with product, design, and security stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving startup environments&lt;/strong&gt;, building autonomous teams that experiment, learn, and deliver at speed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across functions, locations, and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend expertise in RUST&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in decentralized identity solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems with advanced cryptography requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within international environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Budget &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sport Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you? Apply now!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
